### Dados do usuário
GET http://localhost:3001/auth/me
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{Cookie}}

### Buscar veículos
GET http://localhost:3001/vehicles
Cookie: {{Cookie}}

###Buscar ordens de uma compania
GET http://localhost:3001/orders
Cookie: {{Cookie}}

### Buscar ordens de um veículo
GET http://localhost:3001/orders/?plate=RV54JNI64
Cookie: {{Cookie}}

### Buscar veículo pela placa
GET http://localhost:3001/vehicles/RH84AOG
Cookie: {{Cookie}}

### Buscar todas as branchs
GET http://localhost:3001/branchs/
Cookie: {{Cookie}}

### Buscar todas as workshops
GET http://localhost:3001/workshops/
Cookie: {{Cookie}}

### Buscar todas as workshops e veículos em manutenção
GET http://localhost:3001/workshops/vehicles/
Cookie: {{Cookie}}

### Criar novo veículo
POST http://localhost:3001/vehicles
Cookie: {{Cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plate": "ABC-1234",
  "branchId": 31,
  "model": "Civic",
  "brand": "Honda",
  "modelYear": 2023,
  "manufactureYear": 2022,
  "color": "Preto",
  "renavam": "12345678901",
  "chassis": "9BWZZZ377VT004251",
  "status": "AVAILABLE",
  "mileageStart": 0
}